  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759816,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 BIT XMAS 2011 - Christmas Craze (SNES)\n\nGet ready for a uniquely festive and chaotic experience with *Christmas Craze*, the first SNES homebrew game from RetroZone! Gather your best friends and dive into a vibrant, blinky world filled with holiday mayhem. Dodge mischievous aliens while collecting presents, or engage in hilarious two-player snowball battles to steal the spoils from your friends.\n\nThis quirky adventure takes place around the edge of the cartridge itself, creating a visually striking and immersive environment. The game’s colorful lights react dynamically to the action and sound effects, enhancing the festive atmosphere. Expect a playful, slightly surreal experience, where eggnog-fueled revelry meets SNES gaming. \n\n*Christmas Craze* is a charming and original title, showcasing the creativity of the homebrew scene and offering a fresh, lighthearted take on the classic 16-bit era. Prepare for laughter, friendly competition, and a whole lot of Christmas cheer!"
    },
